    "settings.about.contact" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Contact Support"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "お問い合わせ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "settings.about.contact_body" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "■ How can we help?\n\n\n■ If something went wrong, tell us what you can\n- When it happened:\n- What happened (e.g., no reminder when I got to the store):\n- What you were doing:\n- If you have screenshots or a screen recording, please attach them to this email\n\n――――――――――\nThe details below help us look into it. Please leave them as they are.\n"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "■ お問い合わせ内容\n\n\n■ 不具合の場合は、わかる範囲でお書きください\n・起きた日時：\n・どんなことが起きたか（例：お店に着いたのに通知が来なかった）：\n・そのときの操作：\n・スクリーンショットや画面収録があれば、このメールに添付してください\n\n――――――――――\n以下は調査に使う情報です。消さずにそのままお送りください。\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "settings.about.contact_failed_message" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The details for support were copied. Please paste them into an email to %@."
          }
